          1. Official Corrigendum & Last Date Extension Overview
        </h2>
        <p>
          The MPSC Group C Combined Preliminary Examination 2026 advertisement was originally published on <strong>25th June 2026</strong> for 2,619 vacancies. Subsequently, on <strong>22nd July 2026</strong>, MPSC issued a corrigendum adding new posts and revising the total count of vacancies to <strong>5,707 posts</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Considering candidate requests for additional time, MPSC has officially extended the application deadline to <strong>10th August 2026 (23:59 hrs)</strong> via Corrigendum dated <strong>05th August 2026</strong> (Notice No: CMA-0426/CR-42/2026/Advt).
        </p>

