        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-main">
          <li><strong>Age Limit Cutoff Date:</strong> For Talathi applicants, age calculation cutoff is updated to <strong>10 August 2026</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Chandrapur District PESA Posts:</strong> Scheduled Tribe (ST) posts in Chandrapur district under PESA area have been added based on district demand letters.</li>
          <li><strong>PESA Option Submission:</strong> Option/preference is requested from existing and new Talathi applicants for PESA area posts.</li>
          <li><strong>PESA Domicile Certificate Requirement:</strong> ST category applicants applying for PESA posts must produce a PESA Residence Certificate issued by the Integrated Tribal Development Project Office dated before <strong>25 October 2026</strong>. Candidates/spouses/parents/grandparents must be continuous residents of the scheduled area since 26 January 1950.</li>
